                                        "entry_id": "0de67931-50bb-3916-844f-6b93b3e3b917",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A political philosophy that advocates traditional values."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2afa1f02-932d-47e2-ad9b-749893444fbd",
                                                "sense_id": "e5b66642-60b4-3617-be55-f406df777690",
                                                "text": "Oddly, with the liberals and radicals in power in NSW, the conservatives realized that a nominated upper house was no longer a bastion of conservatism and some began to call for an elected legislative council."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99bed43a-8441-3782-8716-ffb4b208e00c",
                                        "entry_id": "0de67931-50bb-3916-844f-6b93b3e3b917",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A risk-averse attitude or approach."
